    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      601.48,
      538.37,
      697.3
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at several places in Northern, North-central, Uva, Eastern, Central and Sabaragamuwa provinces and in Hambantota district after 2.00 p.m. Fairly heavy falls above 75 mm are likely at some places in these areas. Several spells of showers will occur in Western and North-western provinces and in Galle and Matara districts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      9.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      701.08,
      537.86,
      785.26
    ],
    "text": "The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
